---
// Thin line at the very top showing how far through the page you are.
// Updated by the script in CaseStudyLayout; decorative, so hidden from screen readers.
---

<div class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 h-0.5" aria-hidden="true">
  <div data-reading-progress class="h-full origin-left scale-x-0 bg-sage"></div>
</div>
